    <section class="section" id="dashboard">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-num">04</span>
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">Dashboard · Post sorting, filtering &amp; comparison</p>
          <h2>Analytics interface &amp; usability</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="intro">Having the right data only helps if the interface makes it usable. All four tools provide a unified cross-channel dashboard and per-network drill-downs, plus the ability to sort, filter, and rank posts to surface what actually worked. The gaps show up in dashboard flexibility — drag-and-drop layout control — and in how much filtering is gated behind a higher-tier add-on.</p>
