    <section class="section" id="data">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-num">05</span>
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">How current is the data, and how do you get it out</p>
          <h2>Data freshness &amp; export/reporting</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="intro">Freshness and export flexibility are two separate questions tools trade off differently. Zoho Social updates most analytics in real time; Sprout and Hootsuite apply platform-dependent delays that stretch to 48–72 hours for some Facebook and Instagram data; Buffer applies up to a 24-hour lag across most networks. On export, all four cover PDF/CSV/image, but scheduled delivery and white-labelling are plan-gated differently across the board.</p>
