      <p class="utm-lead">UTM tagging is available across all four tools on paid plans. The distinction: <strong>Zoho Social includes custom UTM parameters even on lower-tier plans</strong>, while Buffer and Sprout Social restrict them to paid tiers. Zoho's UTM support spans all connected platforms; Buffer applies it to a defined subset only — Facebook, X, LinkedIn, YouTube Shorts, GMB, Bluesky, TikTok, and Threads.</p>

