coring</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span><span class="cell-rest">Listening add-on: keyword-level sentiment analysis</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span><span class="cell-rest">Listening Basics in all plans</span></td></tr></tbody>
