    <section class="section" id="competitor">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-num">09</span>
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">See how you stack up — without following them</p>
          <h2>Competitor analysis</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="intro">Competitor analysis lets you benchmark posting frequency, engagement, and audience growth against rivals, and monitor conversations about their brand. Buffer offers none of this. Zoho Social lets you monitor competitor profiles and track their keywords/hashtags without a paid add-on, but formal side-by-side performance benchmarking is less explicitly documented than in Sprout or Hootsuite, which both build dedicated competitor benchmark reports.</p>
      
