    <section class="section" id="crosschannel">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-num">10</span>
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">One report across every network you manage</p>
          <h2>Cross-channel reports</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="intro">Once individual networks are analysed, the next need is a single report that rolls reach, engagement, and growth up across the whole social presence. Zoho Social includes a unified dashboard and a multi-channel custom report builder on Professional and Premium plans with no add-on. Sprout gates its custom builder behind Premium Analytics; Hootsuite behind the Team plan; Buffer's Home view is fixed at 7 days with no cross-channel report builder at any tier.</p>
      
    <div class="table-block">
      
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
