iled (Professional &amp; Premium plans)</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span></td><td>Advanced plan only; weekly or monthly</td><td>Team plan and above</td></tr><tr><td class="col-label"><span class="cell-label">Available on free plan</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span><span class="cell-rest">paid only</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span><span class="cell-rest">free plan; 30-day trial only</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span><span class="cell-rest">free plan; 30-day trial only</span></td></tr></tbody>
