      <div class="analysis"><p class="analysis-label">Reading the data</p><p class="analysis-p">This is one of the more clear-cut sections in the whole comparison: Zoho Social is the only tool offering both a multi-channel custom report builder and automated report delivery without requiring a Team-tier or add-on purchase — both come included on Professional and Premium plans. Sprout's equivalent sits behind a Premium Analytics add-on on top of an already-paid plan, and Hootsuite reserves both capabilities for its Team plan and above. Buffer doesn't offer either capability at any tier — its Home dashboard is fixed at a 7-day window with no way to extend it, which rules out month-over-month or quarterly cross-channel reporting inside the tool itself.</p></div>
      
      
