ses aggregated engagement research to recommend publishing times.</span></td></tr><tr><td class="col-label"><span class="cell-label">Best content type recommendation</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span><span class="cell-rest">(Instagram only)</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span><span class="cell-rest">Profile Performance Report</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-unknown"><i class="dot"></i>Not documented</span></td></tr><tr><td class="col-label"><span class="cell-label">Best posting frequency</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span><span class="cell-rest">(Instagram only)</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-unknown"><i class="dot"></i>Not documented</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-unknown"><i class="dot"></i>Not documented</span></td></tr></tbody>
