    <section class="section" id="free-plan">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-num">12</span>
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">Real analytics before you pay a cent</p>
          <h2>Analytics on the free plan</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="intro">Sprout Social and Hootsuite have no permanent free plan — only 30-day trials; once a trial ends, analytics access disappears without a subscription. Zoho Social and Buffer both offer permanent free plans, but neither includes the full analytics suite, audience demographics, or custom reports at that tier.</p>
      
