i>Yes</span><span class="cell-rest">15 days</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span><span class="cell-rest">14 days</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span><span class="cell-rest">30 days</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span><span class="cell-rest">30 days</span></td></tr></tbody>
