    <section class="section" id="crm">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-num">13</span>
        <div>
          <p class="kicker">From social interaction to sales pipeline</p>
          <h2>CRM integration</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="intro">Most social tools stop at reporting. This section covers whether a tool connects social interactions directly to a CRM or helpdesk — turning a mention or comment into a lead or a support ticket. Zoho Social's native Zoho CRM and Zoho Desk integration requires no third-party connector; Sprout and Hootsuite route through Salesforce or HubSpot; Buffer has no CRM integration of any kind.</p>
      
