ill</span></td><td>Channel metric time range of 0 days and up to 200 posts</td><td><span class="stat stat-unknown"><i class="dot"></i>Not documented</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-unknown"><i class="dot"></i>Not documented</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-unknown"><i class="dot"></i>Not documented</span></td></tr><tr><td class="col-label"><span class="cell-label">Free plan post history</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span><span class="cell-rest">(30 days)</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span><span class="cell-rest">free plan</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span><span class="cell-rest">free plan</span></td></tr><tr><td class="col-label"><span class="cell-label">Paid plan post history</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span><span class="cell-rest">stated additional backfill beyond the per-network windows above</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span><span class="cell-rest">(2 years)</span></td><td>Instagram supports up to ~2 years; other networks largely depend on connection date</td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span><span class="cell-rest">data from January 1, 2018</span></td></tr><tr><td class="col-label"><span class="cell-label">Year-over-year comparison</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-partial"><i class="dot"></i>Partial</span><span class="cell-rest">available only after 1+ year of Buffer usage</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span><span class="cell-rest">custom date ranges available</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span><span class="cell-rest">custom date ranges; data from January 2018</span></td></tr><tr><td class="col-label"><span class="cell-label">Instagram audience data backfill</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>No</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span></td></tr><tr><td class="col-label"><span class="cell-label">Instagram Stories backfill</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>Not supported</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-no"><i class="dot"></i>Not supported</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-unknown"><i class="dot"></i>Not explicitly documented</span></td><td><span class="stat stat-yes"><i class="dot"></i>Yes</span></td></tr></tbody>
